# Repository-wide ignores.
#
# The per-project ignores live in api/ and app/. This file covers the root, which had
# none: anything dropped beside the three project folders was untracked and therefore
# one `git add .` away from a public repository.

# Service account keys and other credential files.
#
# A key is not recoverable once pushed, only revocable, and this repository is public.
key/
*-service-account*.json
gcp-*.json
credentials.json

# Database dumps. They carry password hashes and every reading ever taken.
*.dump
*.sql.gz
backup/
backups/
*-backup-*/

# Windows shortcut files, which carry the machine name of whoever made them.
*.lnk
